          "bodySize": 3004,
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 3004,
            "text": "{\"task_id\":\"d81c6c55-2af2-44d4-b125-52a5975793d5\",\"metadata\":{\"prompt\":\"Recreate the motion of the reference video in a sunlit park.\",\"model_prompt\":\"subject_definitions:\\n<Video 1> is the source video containing a SMPTE color bar test pattern with a white circular background and an ascending digital countdown timer from 0 to 3 changing at one-second intervals.\\n\\nsummary:\\n[video reference] The target video recreates the motion of the countdown timer from <Video 1> over the duration of 4.00 seconds, set within a sunlit park environment.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\n<Video 1> (countdown timer and one-second interval pacing): weak_reference - the ascending sequence of countdown numbers from 0 to 3 at one-second intervals is referenced as the core timing structure for the target video.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\nThe target video is in a realistic live-action style with bright natural daylight, dappled sunlight filtering through tall green trees, and soft shadows on a manicured park lawn.\\n[Shot 1] A medium shot frames a weathered wooden park bench resting on the grass beneath a sunlit oak tree. At the center of the wooden backrest, a digital counter display emits a crisp white light showing the digit \\\"0\\\" as soft afternoon sunlight warms the wood surface. The camera holds a static shot while tree leaves sway gently in a mild breeze.\\n[Shot 2] At 01.00 seconds, the shot cuts to a slightly closer framing of the digital counter on the bench as the displayed digit transitions instantly to \\\"1\\\". The camera holds a static shot while dust motes drift slowly through the warm sunlight in the foreground.\\n[Shot 3] At 02.00 seconds, the shot cuts to the same digital counter display on the bench as the digit transitions instantly to \\\"2\\\". The camera holds a static shot while a small bird flits across the background blur behind the sunlit tree trunk.\\n[Shot 4] At 03.00 seconds, the shot cuts to the final framing of the digital counter display on the bench as the digit transitions instantly to \\\"3\\\". The camera holds a static shot as the warm sunlight shifts slightly across the wooden slats of the bench until the end of the video.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nGentle outdoor park ambience with rustling leaves in a mild breeze, distant bird song, and a subtle electronic digital beep occurring precisely at the start of each new second.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nN/A\",\"prompt_expansion_elapsed_ms\":3040,\"prompt_enhancement_level\":null,\"model\":\"MiniMax-H3-MultiMax\",\"task_type\":\"R2V\",\"seed\":888069,\"fps\":null,\"height\":480,\"width\":864,\"aspect_ratio\":\"16:9\",\"resolution_label\":null,\"duration_secs\":4.0,\"num_frames\":null,\"src_image_urls\":null,\"input_video_secs\":4.0,\"src_video_urls\":[\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/justintanner/apicity/d885599410f0a904c1d78ab74019e6a5fa97f00e/tests/fixtures/seedance-ref.mp4\"],\"src_audio_urls\":null,\"src_file_urls\":null,\"src_webpage_urls\":null,\"acceleration\":null,\"adapter\":null,\"draft\":null,\"draft_source_task_id\":null},\"task_output\":null,\"moderation\":null}"
